er delayed -> test\n- [ ] Multiple available delayed tasks ordered by availableAt, then priority, then FIFO -> test\n- [ ] Task exposes `availableAt` -> test\n- [ ] Delays work per named queue -> test\n\n## Phase 5 — Retry with Backoff\n- [ ] `complete(id)` / `fail(id, err)` transition processing tasks -> test\n- [ ] Failed task with retries left is re-queued with exponential backoff `baseDelay*2^(attempt-1)` -> test\n- [ ] Default maxRetries 3, configurable per task -> test\n- [ ] Default baseDelay 1000ms, configurable per task -> test\n- [ ] `attempts` tracked -> test\n- [ ] Retried task keeps queue and priority -> test\n- [ ] Exhausted retries => task in failed state -> test\n\n## Phase 6 — Dead Letter Queue\n- [ ] Exhausted task moved to DLQ of its queue -> test\n- [ ] `getDeadLetterQueue(queue)` lists dead tasks -> test\n- [ ] Dead task retains error + failure count -> test\n- [ ] `retryDeadLetter(id)` moves it back for fresh retries -> test\n- [ ] `clearDeadLetterQueue(queue)` empties it -> test\n- [ ] DLQ is per-queue -> test\n\n## Phase 7 — Dependencies\n- [ ] `add(payload,{dependencies})` blocks until deps complete -> test\n- [ ] Blocked task not returned by `next()` -> test\n- [ ] Completing a dependency unblocks dependents -> test\n- [ ] Circular dependency rejected at creation -> test (cycle helper unit test)\n- [ ] Depending on non-existent task throws -> test\n- [ ] Failed dependency keeps dependents blocked -> test\n- [ ] `getDependencyStatus(id)` inspectable -> test\n\n## Phase 8 — Concurrency Control\n- [ ] Per-queue max concurrency limits simultaneous processing -> test\n- [ ] At limit, `next()` returns null even with pending tasks -> test\n- [ ] complete/fail frees a slot -> test\n- [ ] Default unlimited -> test\n- [ ] `setConcurrency`/`getConcurrency` (limit + active) -> test\n- [ ] Concurrency respects priority ordering -> test\n\n## Phase 9 — Progress & Cancellation\n- [ ] `updateProgress(id, pct, msg?)` (0..100) -> test; out of range throws\n- [ ] `getProgress(id)` -> test\n- [ ] `onProgress(id, fn)` notified on change; returns unsubscribe -> test\n- [ ] Cancel pending: removed from queue, not returned -> test\n- [ ] Cancel processing: status cancelled, slot freed -> test\n- [ ] Cancelled tasks never retried -> test\n\n## Phase 10 — Recurring Tasks\n- [ ] `schedule(cron, payload, opts)` with `*/N * * * *`, `0 * * * *`, `0 0 * * *` -> test\n- [ ] create / remove / list schedules -> test\n- [ ] `tick(now)` enqueues due tasks -> test\n- [ ] Enqueued recurring tasks are normal tasks -> test\n- [ ] Removing a schedule stops future occurrences -> test\n\n## Phase 11 — Middleware Pipeline\n- [ ] `use(queue, mw)` registers middleware; `setHandler(queue, fn)` -> test\n- [ ] `process(queue)` runs middleware in order then handler -> test\n- [ ] Not calling `next` skips handler -> test\n- [ ] Middleware can modify task -> test\n- [ ] Middleware throwing => task failed -> test\n- [ ] Middleware stack is per-queue -> test\n\n## Phase 12 — Graceful Shutdown\n- [ ] `shutdown()` stops accepting tasks; `add` throws after -> test\n- [ ] Waits for processing tasks up to timeout -> test\n- [ ] Force-cancels tasks exceeding timeout -> test\n- [ ] `onShutdown(cb)` callbacks run -> test\n- [ ] Returns summary {completed, forceCancelled, durationMs} -> test\n- [ ] Idempotent (same result) -> test\n- [ ] Immediate when nothing processing -> test\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":142,"cache_read_input_tokens":27700,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":142},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7daedfa6-e22c-4d96-9d85-0b507838aab4","uuid":"8a17f392-eff4-4b3a-b4ba-77875c7c831c","request_id":"req_011CbWE4c2MaLiWdF5MvLKmE"}
